ounted for the sample weights and complex sampling design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Estimates based on <20 cases or with a coefficient of variation >30% were considered unstable, and the rates and CIs were not reported.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Rates per 100,000 population were calculated using U.S. Census Bureau population estimates\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}